It is late now.
In the kitchen, I make a hot cup of tea.
I turn off the main light in the living room.
Then I go into the bedroom.
I bring my tea and lie down in bed.
In bed, I read a good book.
I read for half an hour.
My eyes get very heavy.
I put the book on the nightstand.
Now I have a set routine here in Copenhagen.
I close my eyes and sleep.
